1	// sc4sap:program-to-spec — Screen mockup renderer (SVG → PNG)
2	//
3	// PURPOSE
4	//   Produce PNG images of Selection Screen and ALV layout for the
5	//   "Inputs & Screens" sheet of a generated spec xlsx. Replaces the older
6	//   cell-border wireframe approach (v5..v7) with embedded images.
7	//
8	// PUBLIC API
9	//   renderSelectionScreenSVG({ toolbar?, blocks | fields… })  → svg string
10	//   renderAlvLayoutSVG({ columns, sampleRows, maxRows=3 })   → svg string
11	//   rasterizeSvgToPng(svg, { width, height })                → Promise<Buffer|null>
12	//   renderScreenImages(spec)                                 → Promise<{selection,alv}|null>
13	//
14	// TOKEN ECONOMY (MANDATORY — propagated from SKILL.md)
15	//   · ALV sample rows capped at 3 (configurable up to 5).
16	//   · Minimal SVG: no gradients, no shadows, no emoji glyph payloads.
17	//   · Drop SVG/PNG temp files after rasterization (tmp folder auto-cleaned).
18	//
19	// FALLBACK POLICY
20	//   rasterizeSvgToPng returns null when no headless browser is available
21	//   (Edge/Chrome/Chromium not on PATH, or spawn error). Callers must
22	//   degrade to the legacy cell-border wireframe helpers in
23	//   rich-xlsx-template.mjs (screenFrameRow/screenSubtitleRow/screenMerge)
24	//   so spec generation never crashes on CI without Chrome.
